    note: 'The derivation is what binds execution to intent: an action is read with the ask that produced it.',
  },
  {
    id: 'reach',
    label: 'The reach',
    title: 'Five kinds of entity',
    prose: [
      'Agents, signals, machines, people, and outside systems. A phone states the work, a host performs it on the operator\'s own machine, and a desktop receives the result, with no remote desktop and no file transfer.',
    ],
  },
  {
    id: 'model',
    label: 'The model',
    title: 'A model proposes, and the run stays one chain',
    prose: [
      'A model proposes work. The request, the machine that took it, and the result stay one chain on the record.',
    ],
  },
  {
    id: 'in-use',
    label: 'In use',
    title: 'A fleet on one host',
    prose: ['The Kletos fleet runs dozens of instances on one host.'],
